"<p>This tool allows users to blend bracketed images together to create "
"pseudo HDR photo.</p><p>To create high definition range image, you need to "
"use images from same subject taken with a tripod and exposed with different "
"exposure settings.</p><p>To create image with better results, you can use "
"RAW images instead JPEG, where colors depth is higher and are well adapted "
"for merging pixels by pixels.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>This tool allows users to blend bracketed images together to create "
"pseudo HDR photo.</p><p>To create high definition range image, you need to "
"use images from same subject taken with a tripod and exposed with different "
"exposure settings.</p><p>To create image with better results, you can use "
"RAW images instead JPEG, where colors depth is higher and are well adapted "
"for merging pixels by pixels.</p>"

