"\"ptpipcamera\">%1</a> zo zoznamu fotoaparátov.</p>"

#: core/utilities/setup/camera/cameraselection.cpp:231
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>A complete list of camera settings to use is<br>available at <a "
